<title>USA: I2 Technologies Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>I2 Technologies Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>i2 TECHNOLOGIES, INC.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							     Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>									   1996     1997</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>	 Software licenses				     $9,620  $20,947</p>
<p>	 Services						   1,844    7,833</p>
